      "writtenOn": "2023-07-07T15:00:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can refactor the existing `vmbase/rand.rs` and `pvmfw/crypto.rs` into a new module `vmbase/crypto/`, which will contain the following files:\n\n- `trng.rs`: This file will contain the existing TRNG code, including the `trng::random_array()` function.\n- `error.rs`: This file will define error types specific to cryptographic operations.\n- `prng.rs`: This file will contain the new PRNG code, including\n  * `prng::seed()`. I would prefer to keep the name seed as it is more clear and less generic than `init` from a cryptographic standpoint.\n  * `prng::random_array()`\n- `aead.rs`: We can consider moving the `pvmfw/crypto.rs` AEAD code to this file. This will also make it easier for Rialto to use the AEAD code in the future.\n\nwdyt?",
      "parentUuid": "427187ac_d8835b24",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 169,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 169,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "d5879d7e72f397ad8a06d4556beeeea440c96233",
